>> title: Chapati
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: bread, indian, whole wheat, griddle
>> counters: Curry House
>> aka: chapatti, chappati, roti, phulka
>> pairs-with: dal-tadka, chana-masala
>> servings: 8
>> time: 45 min
>> step.4: roll thin, cook on a dry tawa 1 min per side, pressing to puff

Whisk @atta{2%cup}(240 g; Indian whole wheat flour) with @fine sea salt{3/4%tsp}(4 g).

Knead @&(~1)flour{}, @vegetable oil{2%tsp}(10 mL), and @warm water{3/4%cup}(180 mL) into a soft dough.

Rest @&(~1)dough{} covered ~{30%min}.

Roll @&(~1)dough{} into 6-in rounds and cook on a dry #tawa{} ~{1%min} per side, pressing until they puff.

Brush @&(~1)chapati{} with @ghee{2%Tbsp}(28 g).
